களத்து உயர்க நும் வேலே; கொடுவரிக்\nகோள்மாக் குயின்ற சேண்விளங்கு தொடுபொறி\nநெடுநீர்க் கெண்டையடு பொறித்த\nகுடுமிய ஆக, பிறர் குன்றுகெழு நாடே."}],"supporting_assertion_ids":[],"assertion_provenance_status":"direct_r15_source_review_no_prior_assertion","confidence":"high","review_status":"reviewed","reviewer_type":"assistant_assisted","historical_identity_status":"not_applicable","note":"Source-explicit evidence retained without external expansion."},{"observation_id":"obs.prod.r15.0599eda21c593eb0fdb2f033","dimension":"flora","concept_id":null,"evidence_class":"SOURCE_EXPLICIT","classification_basis":"direct_record_review","evidence_refs":[{"source_field":"canonical_body","source_location":"markdown:canonical-body","evidence_span":{"start_line":2,"start_character":0,"end_line":3,"end_character":41},"source_text":"முழுமுதல் தொலைந்த கோளி ஆலத்துக்\nகொழுநிழல் நெடுஞ்சினை வீழ்பொறுத் தாங்குத்,"},{"source_field":"canonical_body","source_location":"markdown:canonical-body","evidence_span":{"start_line":11,"start_character":0,"end_line":11,"end_character":32},"source_text":"வரைய சாந்தமும், திரைய முத்தமும்,"}],"supporting_assertion_ids":[],"assertion_provenance_status":"direct_r15_source_review_no_prior_assertion","confidence":"high","review_status":"reviewed","reviewer_type":"assistant_assisted","historical_identity_status":"not_applicable","note":"Source-explicit evidence retained without external expansion."},{"observation_id":"obs.prod.r15.46e303c6d5f53a4846a33593","dimension":"fauna","concept_id":null,"evidence_class":"SOURCE_EXPLICIT","classification_basis":"direct_record_review","evidence_refs":[{"source_field":"canonical_body","source_location":"markdown:canonical-body","evidence_span":{"start_line":27,"start_character":0,"end_line":30,"end_character":34},"source_text":"அடுகளத்து உயர்க நும் வேலே; கொடுவரிக்\nகோள்மாக் குயின்ற சேண்விளங்கு தொடுபொறி\nநெடுநீர்க் கெண்டையடு பொறித்த\nகுடுமிய ஆக, பிறர் குன்றுகெழு நாடே."}],"supporting_assertion_ids":[],"assertion_provenance_status":"